  - > 2.0: Low Similarity (Largely different topics/meanings)"""
BERTSCORE_EXPLANATION = """BERTScore (F1 Score: 0 to 1): Compares contextual embeddings (like BERT) for words in candidate and reference texts. Calculates Precision, Recall, and F1 score based on cosine similarity of aligned words.
